{'symbol': 'ODFL', 'date': '2023-06-30 14:50:00', 'title': 'OLD DOMINION FREIGHT LINE RELEASES 2022 ESG REPORT', 'text': 'THOMASVILLE, N.C.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--OLD DOMINION FREIGHT LINE, INC. (NASDAQ: ODFL) ANNOUNCED TODAY THE RELEASE OF ITS 2022 ENVIRONMENTAL, SOCIAL AND GOVERNANCE (ESG) REPORT. THE 2022 ESG REPORT CONTENT HAS BEEN INFORMED BY THE SUSTAINABILITY ACCOUNTING STANDARDS BOARD (SASB) ROAD TRANSPORTATION SUSTAINABILITY ACCOUNTING STANDARD AND IS REPORTED WITH REFERENCE TO THE GLOBAL REPORTING INITIATIVE (GRI) STANDARDS. THE ESG REPORT IS AVAILABLE UNDER THE CORPORATE RESPONSIBILITY SECTION OF THE COMPANY.'}